  "printerMaintenance.title": "Printer Maintenance",
  "printerMaintenance.section.status": "Status",
  "printerMaintenance.section.status.help": "Printer status refreshes every five seconds while connected and pauses while you scroll.",
  "printerMaintenance.section.headMaintenance": "Head Maintenance",
  "printerMaintenance.section.headMaintenance.help": "Head mask is a bitmask: bit 0 selects head 1 and bit 1 selects head 2, so 3 selects both X-33 heads. Nozzle Check prints the SDK diagnostic pattern. Automatic Head Cleaning runs the printer automatic cleaning cycle. Manual Cleaning runs the pump for the selected heads until stopped. Flushing rapidly fires the selected nozzles at the maintenance station; stop either operation when cleaning is complete.",
  "printerMaintenance.section.motionHeight": "Motion and Height",
  "printerMaintenance.section.motionHeight.help": "Press and hold an arrow to move; releasing it stops that axis. Stop & Home immediately stops the active axis and sends the print head to its capped home position. A 30-second safety timeout prevents unattended motion. Print height is in millimeters and accepts two decimal places.",
  "printerMaintenance.section.settingsConfig": "Settings and Config",
  "printerMaintenance.section.settingsConfig.help": "Read the engine current job settings before applying changes. Import/export uses the vendor PFG configuration file format.",
  "printerMaintenance.section.alignment": "Alignment",
  "printerMaintenance.section.alignment.help": "Value type selects which alignment field to write. Pattern type selects a printer-generated calibration chart. Use the dedicated Head Maintenance button for the common nozzle check; this section exposes all pattern types for advanced alignment work.",
  "printerMaintenance.section.xyUv": "XY and UV",
  "printerMaintenance.section.xyUv.help": "XY offsets are in millimeters. UV value types map to the right/left lamp directional offsets documented by the SDK. New UV controls are active only on firmware that reports support.",
